{"title": "Shadowheart/Cut content", "pageid": 48057, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadowheart/Cut_content", "categories": ["Legacy content", "Cut content subpages"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r349439\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:20px 10%;border-left:10px solid #969696;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:40px}.mw-parser-output table.ambox+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+link+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+style+table.ambox{margin-top:-1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-imageright{padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-notice{border-left-color:#969696}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy{background-color:#400805}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy,.mw-parser-output table.ambox-delete{border-left-color:#b50000}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-content{border-left-color:#de5f16}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-style{border-left-color:#f0c146}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-protection{border-left-color:#4f4a39}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-move{border-left-color:#587cd1}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small{clear:right;float:right;margin:4px 0 4px 1em;box-sizing:border-box;width:238px;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}</style><table class=\"ambox ambox-notice plainlinks metadata\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Invisible_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about gameplay elements – such as characters, quests or mechanics – that have been <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Legacy_content\" title=\"Category:Legacy content\">removed from the game</a> and are <b>no longer available</b>.</div></td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"margin-bottom: 1em;\"><table role=\"navigation\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable bg3wiki-tabbar\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Cut_and_unimplemented_content\" title=\"Cut and unimplemented content\">Cut Content</a></td>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Unimplemented_spells\" title=\"Unimplemented spells\">Unimplemented spells</a></td>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab bg3wiki-tab-active\"> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shadowheart</a></td>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Aylin/Cut_content\" title=\"Aylin/Cut content\">Nightsong</a></td>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Helia\" title=\"Helia\">Helia</a></td>\n<td class=\"bg3wiki-tab\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Rurik\" title=\"Rurik\">Rurik</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> had at some point in development a vastly different backstory and storyline that was completely revamped prior to the game's release. This previous version of Shadowheart once had a <a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">high elven</a> mother named <b>Eliriana</b>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> father named <b>Sebastian</b>, had been acquainted with a <b>Mother Superior</b> (different from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/25px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/38px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/50px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Viconia DeVir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/25px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\">Viconia DeVir</a>), a <b>Sister Superior</b>, as well as a <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Sharran</a> <b>torturer</b>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Family\">Family</span></h2>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Eliriana</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Eliriana.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png 1x, /w/images/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Eliriana.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a><br>Sebastian</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n     <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Sebastian</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Sebastian 2.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Sebastian 2.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a><br>Eliriana</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<b>Eliriana</b> and <b>Sebastian</b> were once designed to be Shadowheart's parents sometime before <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arnell_Hallowleaf\" title=\"Arnell Hallowleaf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png/25px-Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png/38px-Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png/50px-Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arnell Hallowleaf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png/25px-Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Portrait_Arnell_Hallowleaf.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arnell_Hallowleaf\" title=\"Arnell Hallowleaf\">Arnell Hallowleaf</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emmeline_Hallowleaf\" title=\"Emmeline Hallowleaf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png/25px-Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png/38px-Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png/50px-Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Emmeline Hallowleaf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png/25px-Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Emmeline_Hallowleaf.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Emmeline_Hallowleaf\" title=\"Emmeline Hallowleaf\">Emmeline Hallowleaf</a> were created / finalized. Unlike their current counterparts, the mother, Eliriana, was a high elf and therefore the longer-living parent of the two, with Sebastian being a human. It is likely that they were both <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/30px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/40px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selûnite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûnite</a>, like their actual counterparts, judging by Shadowheart's both redesigned and current backstory.\n<p>At some point in late <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, there was a now currently-defunct bridge in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>, which was planned to be an entrance of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a>. And on entering this temple of Shar from here, would have triggered a memory of Shadowheart (with a fallback version that could trigger as a dream in camp), in that she would have gone through a cinematic flashback of her being forced to torture her parents, mainly plucking teeth from her father's mouth with a set of pliers, on the Sister Superior's orders.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/70px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/105px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/140px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/70px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Look. Find your truest self in Shar's darkness. She will spare you, forgive you.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_2\" title=\"Sebastian 2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png/70px-Portrait_Sebastian_2.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png/105px-Portrait_Sebastian_2.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png/140px-Portrait_Sebastian_2.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png/70px-Portrait_Sebastian_2.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Sebastian_2.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">No... but I forgive you.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sebastian 2\">Sebastian</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eliriana\" title=\"Eliriana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png/70px-Portrait_Eliriana.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png/105px-Portrait_Eliriana.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png/140px-Portrait_Eliriana.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png/70px-Portrait_Eliriana.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Eliriana.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">We both do.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Eliriana\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eliriana\">Eliriana</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p>With the ultimate goal of converting her parents to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>, her parents' forgiveness and resistance to both torture and Sharran dogma leaves Shadowheart hysterical and on the verge of breaking down, before she is struck and punished by the Sister Superior for failing. At this point in time, Shadowheart is unaware that they are her parents, with her memories of them having already been wiped.\n</p><p>It is possible that both Eliriana and Sebastian were placeholders of a bygone time, from before the Hallowleafs were completely finished in their design - for instance, both of Shadowheart's current parents use face models unique to them, while Eliriana and Sebastian use generic faces that are available in <a href=\"/wiki/Character_creation\" title=\"Character creation\">character creation</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sharrans\">Sharrans</span></h2>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Sister Superior</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Umbralspleen.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png 1x, /w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Umbralspleen.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"full name\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Full Name</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Umbralspleen (placeholder)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n     <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Mother Superior</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Eclipsekidney.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Eclipsekidney.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Eclipsekidney.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Eclipsekidney.png 1x, /w/images/b/be/Portrait_Eclipsekidney.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Eclipsekidney.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"full name\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Full Name</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Eclipsekidney (placeholder)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n     <aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Sharran Torturer</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Portrait_Darkliver.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Darkliver.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/b/b8/Portrait_Darkliver.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/b/b8/Portrait_Darkliver.png 1x, /w/images/b/b8/Portrait_Darkliver.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Darkliver.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"full name\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Full Name</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Darkliver (placeholder)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium\">Medium</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoid</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/High_Half-Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Half-Elf\">High Half-Elf</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\nA variety of now either cut or redesigned Sharrans were also once present in Shadowheart's backstory, with the <b>Sister Superior</b> taking on a tormenting and abusive role, the <b>Mother Superior</b> manipulating and sending her on a mission for the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Artefact\" title=\"Mysterious Artefact\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Mysterious_Artefact_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Artefact\" title=\"Mysterious Artefact\">Astral Prism</a>, and a <b>Torturer</b> that would have been torturing her.\n\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbralspleen\" title=\"Umbralspleen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png/70px-Portrait_Umbralspleen.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png/105px-Portrait_Umbralspleen.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png/140px-Portrait_Umbralspleen.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png/70px-Portrait_Umbralspleen.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Umbralspleen.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">The torment of a foe is a wondrous gift for Shar. Make an offering to her.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Umbralspleen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Umbralspleen\">Sister Superior</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p>In the Grymforge flashback, the <b>Sister Superior</b> would have been hitting and striking Shadowheart, all the while reciting Sharran dogma. When Shadowheart asks her who the two people that are her parents are, the Sister Superior simply refer to them as <i>\"enemies of Shar\"</i> before demanding complete obedience from her.\n</p><p>As the torture ends, the Sister Superior gives her a back-handed compliment. The Sister Superior then demands Shadowheart to educate them on the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nightsinger's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Nightsinger's</a> truth, to no avail. She eventually dissolves into anger as the parents forgive Shadowheart for what she has done. The Sister Superior would then go on to verbally berate her, before sparks of bright light start to emanate from Shadowheart's left hand; before the Sister Superior can escape, a blast of raw magic overcomes her, either killing her or incapacitating her.\n</p><p>The scene then changes, with Shadowheart being tied to a torture chair and tortured by a Sharran <b>torturer's</b> <i>\"strange thin dagger\"</i>, while the <b>Mother Superior</b> watches on. As the torturer inflicts torment on Shadowheart, the Mother Superior gives her the mission to retrieve the Astral Prism.\n</p><p>It is unclear whether the Mother Superior is simply an old version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/25px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/38px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/50px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Viconia DeVir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/25px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\">Viconia DeVir</a>, or was supposed to be an entirely different character. It is also not known whether or not any of these characters were supposed to make another appearance later in the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> or elsewhere. Each of them has been given a placeholder name within the game files, with the Sister Superior's being <i>`Umbralspleen`</i>; the Mother Superior <i>`Eclipsekidney`</i>, and the Torturer <i>`Darkliver`</i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mysterious_Wound\">Mysterious Wound</span></h2>\n<p>Shadowheart's mysterious wound on her right hand is currently a byproduct of Shar's interference and cruelty in the released versions of the game. Previously in <a href=\"/wiki/Early_Access\" title=\"Early Access\">Early Access</a> and earlier, Shadowheart's wound was found on her left hand, and was originally meant to represent Selûne's interference. It was originally presented as a <i>`blast of raw magical energy`</i>, and <i>`sparks of silver (like stars or moonlight)`</i> within the dialogue files.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Physically, Early Access versions prior to Patch 7 showed the wound on her left hand, the magical energy to be a white/silver colour and to be emanating sparks and beams of light.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Moonhaven\">Moonhaven</span></h2>\n<p>It's possible that Shadowheart was originally conceived to have grown up in Moonhaven, the former name for the now ruined <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>. Her unique reaction upon picking up the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Schoolbook\" title=\"Old Schoolbook\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Schoolbook\" title=\"Old Schoolbook\">Old Schoolbook</a> or her scene at the Selûnite statue behind the mill once being telltale signs of her past presence in the village. However, it's difficult to confirm as different sources in-game indicate that the village was destroyed over a hundred years ago by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar\" title=\"Dark Justiciar\">Dark Justiciar</a> army, and Shadowheart is estimated to be roughly fifty years old. Conflicting timelines regarding the village and its destruction do not line up, thus, it is possible that the intent during development was that she and her family had indeed lived in Moonhaven, but that the inconsistencies were never properly fixed for release, leading to that storyline being scrapped.<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oplQmoIxICI&amp;t=2m34s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"The Hidden Dev Secrets of BG3 Act 2\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oplQmoIxICI&amp;t=2m34s\">The Hidden Dev Secrets of BG3 Act 2</a></span>&nbsp;–&nbsp;SlimX </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CinematicNodeContext (developer's notes) within the old cutscene/dialogue files) </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MamUGrFzUZQ&amp;t=14s\" title=\"Patch 6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart Statue &amp; Helmet Sorcerer Dialogue\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MamUGrFzUZQ&amp;t=14s\">Shadowheart Statue &amp; Helmet Sorcerer Dialogue | BG3 | Patch 6</a></span>&nbsp;–&nbsp;McAllik </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Her main writer, John Corcoran, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://x.com/mrjohncorcoran/status/1732495757935050919\">has stated</a> she grew up in Moonhaven. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231700\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.402 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.412 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19544/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 200928/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 79485/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 10/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 23243/5000000 bytes\nExt